t my personal best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Track your progress</strong>\u00a0with your personal best times for reaching layer 10, 20, 30, 40 and 50</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>tips and tricks</strong> in the &quot;How to Play&quot; section</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>3 Save files</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All progress is saved automatically</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your game with the following options:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme: Light / Dark</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Accessibility</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parallax: on / off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer: Full / Simple / Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Particles: All / Reduced / Off</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Font: Default / Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contrast: Low / Medium / High (possible to play in black and white)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Controls</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse button rebinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard key rebinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input: Release / Same Tile / Press</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional settings to make inputs safer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give MineDeeper a try for yourself and let me know what you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy!</p>","developers":["Jace"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104630/560655b061c9f5c3cedf31401ad5934285c5208a/header.jpg?t=1765648394","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_a